      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}\n\nThere's no reason to have the file size limits on worlds/avatars, as that's not a performance issue. Again, most of this is wanting more features to be available on Quest, and making it easier to optimize.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
