  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-12-18T11:33:59.055Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "VRChat on Quest is way too restricted. And for those who say otherwise, the current restrictions for Quest were made for the Quest 1, and have only gotten more and more restricted. Both the Quest 1 and 2 are discontinued, and the Quest 3/ Quest 3 S are more powerful than a PS4, if only by a small amount.\n\nI'm not asking to see every shader, or every world, or every avatar, because I'm not dumb, I know the Quest is less powerful than a PC. I'm asking for Avatar Audio, More Shaders, and less restrictions involving optimization for Quest. Most of the current avatars that lag quest also lag PC users, I've seen it myself.\n\nSo in all, I'm asking for, on Quest\n\n• More Shaders\n\n• Avatar file size increase\n\n• World file size increase\n\n• Avatar Audio\n\nAnd if Quest users find it too taxing or laggy, you can simply turn off shaders and avatar audio, to have the benefits of the Avatar/World file increase, and even then, you can turn down the maximum sizes for that too\n\nThank you for your time.",
